---
description: Global AI development rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read AGENTS.md before changes.
- Work only within active task scope.
- Prefer the smallest safe complete change.
- Do not perform unrelated refactoring.
- Never expose or commit secrets.
- Require a plan before coding.
- Add regression tests for bug fixes.
- Report actual validation results only.
- Update handoff and changelog.
